{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:47:18.918Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Refining Dockerfile user creation logic**\n\nI'm designing a robust Dockerfile snippet that conditionally runs usermod with `-o` to allow UID reuse or useradd with `-o` to prevent build failures due to existing UID 1000, while ensuring group creation is idempotent; this addresses build errors from UID conflicts and aligns container UID/GID with the host user."}}
