{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:48:43.519Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Analyzing permission issues on host-created directories**\n\nThe `.orch` directory may be created by the container as root, causing host server writes to fail due to ownership conflicts and permission denials; resolving this likely requires ensuring `.orch` is created or chowned by the server before container runs to avoid `PermissionDenied` errors when removing or writing to directories."}}
{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:48:43.519Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Diagnosing container root-owned file issues**\n\nContainer entrypoint or processes running as root create root-owned `.orch` directories on the host, causing permission problems since the server runs as a non-root user; fixing this requires creating `.orch` on the host before container startup or ensuring container writes use a matching non-root UID, possibly by adjusting volume mounts and docker-compose codex auth paths."}}
{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:48:43.519Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"reasoning","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Analyzing permission issues on host-created directories**\n\nThe `.orch` directory may be created by the container as root, causing host server writes to fail due to ownership conflicts and permission denials; resolving this likely requires ensuring `.orch` is created or chowned by the server before container runs to avoid `PermissionDenied` errors when removing or writing to directories."},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Diagnosing container root-owned file issues**\n\nContainer entrypoint or processes running as root create root-owned `.orch` directories on the host, causing permission problems since the server runs as a non-root user; fixing this requires creating `.orch` on the host before container startup or ensuring container writes use a matching non-root UID, possibly by adjusting volume mounts and docker-compose codex auth paths."}],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpaWCzldlA5c-vJ5YhxpYYqFe-bwq71d03aP9FFYpiuCt_zYomCEG_hJAil83I3i205tsNGRceen_Cf44l6h2LC0TslH3otNpL4bvgeSf5CdNrNnlf6wshvXn5xToUKZ0_YIDyoyJoubSWUg1RRLfzVE-vEzNyQI3MWi9YyyzQ6mQdmYyBtBSYbh7OMeiwL50_H7SwElDJy_kx0eJlGmzX6uVofx--EsublV5PtwpH09rDcZ8cmIJJmCvTiMKOIGGYRokP3sxFJ0i2GW5-YYVgqsPsSN64r9uptu1kyFd_RYCmrpfsFbZt4oZhV5pS_qyBbIGPCzyOuze_ENv94g_WHuOPxiHkoCCL2dzSF8vJXqz91ZyNfmCMgupWFO6tdzN9mgQJk0bBfoFunAOpwTKngp_RAZboK5p1ex7i3kDUCzR2If1mWx5PufcYFFunf_5zDek7bFCnXHtXBsQ2qbpbygBYSp4cjFCY6qfBZPfmc1ZyYKsUm9-y8cKB68xrg4I9-YhpHPELc064_q3GhEjIsjeci6FNQjLRBlCPgktowFyJjRiCuQB2SM_AnLG5VDXC4OLqXW6ZPm--8o_vgvvuxps1NIFJ_QaMxQ8XlKaBaeLYxpTd6oF16GjQGtacwU0iLtsPk-U9hNiXxhpfnQRauMBhlGRlQ9riFL1h6GLAwlxI4yq7gCaJKVO41yH21l6DhsnyUTOa5JllL_Y7YIllB8Ps6cdtIDvoLvZFFde6IPD7UXpvc0MxzwK4TPZuaInP1IkJJt4XYAlrJziW720d3Jjq99gW5wiHqUY1C-qmo13OLulOOy4RNUNBexJv-fPQwj20nSU0zAl3XEMuol51bomev0QVvXm4D8oSChA1cneZHeFHxHDQnJlsTn2l2gVR_TdUSp_pB_NxLVCgmDAdNpRmHChUfMKcpK2mJBcEUl7PzGc5S21drX-zMnaPE0OpKB9