{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:51:32.777Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Deciding codex auth path mounting**\n\nThe codex auth path should be mounted from a separate, writable host directory into the container's `/.codex` to preserve credentials safely, possibly using `.docker-git/secrets/codex-host` per project for isolation rather than the default in-project `.orch` folder."}}
{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:51:32.777Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Diagnosing codex auth permission issues and UID fix**\n\nThe root cause of codex sync skipping is host path ownership conflicts caused by container root writing to mounted volumes, creating root-owned files the host user cannot overwrite. Aligning the container dev user's UID to host UID 1000 and chowning auth paths inside entrypoint will fix permissions, enabling successful sync. Next, I'll ensure Dockerfile templates correctly handle dev user creation with UID 1000 and instruct users to clean or reset existing `.orch` directories to avoid stale root-owned files blocking writes."}}
{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:51:32.777Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"reasoning","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Deciding codex auth path mounting**\n\nThe codex auth path should be mounted from a separate, writable host directory into the container's `/.codex` to preserve credentials safely, possibly using `.docker-git/secrets/codex-host` per project for isolation rather than the default in-project `.orch` folder."},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Diagnosing codex auth permission issues and UID fix**\n\nThe root cause of codex sync skipping is host path ownership conflicts caused by container root writing to mounted volumes, creating root-owned files the host user cannot overwrite. Aligning the container dev user's UID to host UID 1000 and chowning auth paths inside entrypoint will fix permissions, enabling successful sync. Next, I'll ensure Dockerfile templates correctly handle dev user creation with UID 1000 and instruct users to clean or reset existing `.orch` directories to avoid stale root-owned files blocking writes."}],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpaWFcr9IbmqrqFOZvh6MJVrnDT6krSV96tIi5qwMGaDvK4uvCXf92ZKVO1qUIz7dmUhNxyUAp9uwB8KRMhIy1ltARUhCVxzlOjpuOoWxNjbadTjw82eD1niWvKWrgW-VypRPyC8NOqoUTDHVAjK6BxVr9qI8SuSYvAn5kHgZ5yRrSjB_9hpWMCpY9Lzfs7o5OWbW3l6nAqBps1JXtKZxbEgEv1hS9E0LoKJFc9TJ1uAiZzC_Cm133AnzFtMdtD8qC6552znyA2XyX939tSrkpDbYLgesuVGHXRSOxQn5JpEnx8_N18Jaa5ZsgpWJSPWrnc39DHXOe0KLnQqRrqIGesiu4kP8m7PXqK2FFqdYD_yIt-bBQu12D-g2qoacCqvaKw2JLCyG9hxDYbrT6x_FWF8kyMF7j6apPplgV0kCCZtHku8l67WBhrzzoyI3jrssZWvxH_gp4PCl_ipOrLAqE_fZA_8h9i0WpNK4qZMbdW_Zn4XAVIzor_m3ywhaIdytE5j-xKEEh6R75ZpBNdURcshRipiHE3LSlYHZzoMsNv6qC8MiPPz6VZHuC7pmOUtRKdf0CJi43IXO--YzJMQh6ntwT__gelIJXWEyUoC_v6FbnvKmwDAuuJXvA4GA2MHIFpeHkrqfok1yKtnPHgn2C_nbiM_AkMAZhGLXA2O7-IKbwcOzckQdC_1KxJHMqahP799DWZ38DHlutyhOGJIKuscObLK1-gi4myW_4OSvnEWBoJyRBnZThYgJiL0f1NyYggOjulm3X2Qj4ImYJEjDEBN1AScRydeelUVtF6oNqXZY6yCxHDblFLcjNQi2jPur3dc9Bq3VN57tMYrLBih_iJri0PHsmzmQP_eMviXw6e0m7Lvt_wrSXrC6d