{"timestamp":"2026-01-15T21:56:11.228Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Summarizing Docker build issues and fixes**\n\nThe Docker build failed due to codex authorization and UID conflicts; the fixes applied include a more robust codex auth fallback when `.orch/auth/codex` isn't writable, updating docker-compose accordingly, and addressing UID 1000 conflicts via `useradd -o` in the Dockerfile template. Next steps are rebuilding and recreating the server container and possibly cleaning up old root-owned `.orch` directories. Verified commands to check container logs can be provided on request."}}
