{"timestamp":"2026-01-16T09:03:44.231Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"function_call_output","call_id":"call_qxqYzBh9HwcuTdrvV0bVarDK","output":"Exit code: 0\nWall time: 0.1 seconds\nOutput:\ntime=\"2026-01-16T13:03:44+04:00\" level=warning msg=\"Docker Compose requires buildx plugin to be installed\"\n Image effect-eslint-template-dg-effect-eslint-template Building \n Image effect-eslint-template-dg-effect-eslint-template Building \nSending build context to Docker daemon  2.375kB\r\r\nStep 1/23 : FROM ubuntu:24.04\n ---> c3a134f2ace4\nStep 2/23 : ENV DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive\n ---> Using cache\n ---> e30d7f7aa2bd\nStep 3/23 : RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends     openssh-server git gh ca-certificates nodejs npm curl unzip bsdutils sudo  && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 4d493b65b1c7\nStep 4/23 : RUN npm i -g pnpm@10.27.0\n ---> Using cache\n ---> fba92b0bcf11\nStep 5/23 : ENV BUN_INSTALL=/usr/local/bun\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 69dc3a43dc74\nStep 6/23 : ENV TERM=xterm-256color\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 4ab03eeeab62\nStep 7/23 : ENV PATH=\"/usr/local/bun/bin:$PATH\"\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 5422d45228ff\nStep 8/23 : RUN curl -fsSL https://bun.sh/install | bash\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 7cd963b485ae\nStep 9/23 : RUN ln -sf /usr/local/bun/bin/bun /usr/local/bin/bun\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 4ce732e4f4fa\nStep 10/23 : RUN script -q -e -c \"bun add -g @openai/codex@latest\" /dev/null\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 415897f29cc5\nStep 11/23 : RUN ln -sf /usr/local/bun/bin/codex /usr/local/bin/codex\n ---> Using cache\n ---> 0539cc921219\nStep 12/23 : RUN printf \"export BUN_INSTALL=/usr/local/bun\\nexport PATH=/usr/local/bun/bin:\\$PATH\\n\"   > /etc/profile.d/bun.sh && chmod 0644 /etc/profile.d/bun.sh\n ---> Using cache\n ---> edd7b3943d16\nStep 13/23 : RUN groupadd -g 1000 dev || true\n ---> Using cache\n ---> e81d85a068a0\nStep 14/23 : RUN if id -u dev >/dev/null 2>&1; then       usermod -u 1000 -g 1000