{"timestamp":"2026-01-16T09:10:26.815Z","type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"agent_reasoning","text":"**Diagnosing permission issue with /home/dev volume**\n\nThe `/home/dev` directory is a Docker volume likely owned by a different UID from the container’s root, causing `su - dev` permission denied errors despite chown attempts in the entrypoint running as root. This suggests runtime ownership conflicts with the mounted volume need explicit root chown after container start."}}
