{"timestamp":"2026-01-16T09:10:26.815Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"reasoning","summary":[{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Diagnosing permission issue with /home/dev volume**\n\nThe `/home/dev` directory is a Docker volume likely owned by a different UID from the container’s root, causing `su - dev` permission denied errors despite chown attempts in the entrypoint running as root. This suggests runtime ownership conflicts with the mounted volume need explicit root chown after container start."},{"type":"summary_text","text":"**Planning conditional chown in entrypoint**\n\nPermission issues likely stem from skipping chown when repo already exists in the volume, causing ownership mismatch. I'll add a check using `stat` to conditionally chown `/home/dev` at entrypoint start before `su`, updating ownership only when needed to avoid unnecessary overhead."}],"content":null,"encrypted_content":"gAAAAABpagB33750M5IZi04UJhCxdmk8iWYLO-nEb5-p0qf0T2BZaxgRS4whKKrSAtRblyGvn-qZuksQ-72EfRlaqQxpUQLrqqkOHhqBPN1rj-iw3O3QffFIdjjxYTmB9OXt1WLbqxHJEv0_ZGV30EPH-HgZesHphdN7jsw7-TLhB0358qp2q1z8GpeSWaPAc06pGS_jyg0_FZTBzK2l9isbr1KRzzhLoVfW3ibElxr0z10qLWx5L_KJU0rol76WuPXZBf97nfRpWC6vhbFEoSjHZbbqhhl85nY3z4KZPZ_NpBbsyZIVRh5AwCpeUM8pco4I__wcKXS3WvbS-ManE4YYD_T5iyLXCX45MJwJLVkFCjxW6q94_Zld1mvXvTj0-85Ej9G7jaTu0l8biK-GDkSe460aSI1yzqecAZgvga1qUIUKNapbKxTnfmE7mN8arYqzUE3nwZU6Hp3xcz14_nHTD8utCzQ1wNoeqRre2vjwsshsowOf_DMKrBo1kFRDA1Ri1xHViRmxQftYb4nlexeGXZ5rVUp-qdJlGl04MIJNF15szvlKtd-5r2bEGb7fRFg390OGr7JKMaKgzHW2yH0Chc_KOLeisOSs1X9pDK6JuDnSEzQ-WVSEkff6OIje5GShEC4s0IvWAJmvE6RoMhQGCEjwuzhRCdJAG19BWluGUFsAA4f7FrS0EgxkAzSqe4PM-43SVK0O9_phuJrPt1A1GePImj0dHXNW807iKrAOedNkxZNkDz9z1T5Y9QqynQstVFZ2U7ipBnwm8EZCb3H0tsFqEJZHi9jg-KjgKzPaoAEtDXAXViKiVVyoD4FvZsYuL_U1ovQJAgY_Ub7JAODAC67u8EzCPiSAdiNljRpuwVjUBFvEcteAMmMCACzsZv0MmBPG05xCeOiZqN8oADQ_W8QtDPwMw2nt9EhBmfItlgcSg0wjFW7yXOS8ztimwzG1SOyaOxuTbQd_t8VeSNlRzpi7umGT0hA54WCJLdg6_GuYkRAralYxpuMo_AvmZ0zCnJnlTjf-sAi7S5ToH92vDNc_T_PH31H6ojvvjviyL5GZ9WIRjrNYXNPpi