{"timestamp":"2026-01-16T10:34:04.936Z","type":"response_item","payload":{"type":"custom_tool_call","status":"completed","call_id":"call_MDxyWkyKephfDrFiPuGoV1sF","name":"apply_patch","input":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /home/user/docker-git/effect-template/packages/docker-git/src/core/templates.ts\n@@\n-// CHANGE: install bun+codex for all users with visible progress and sudo access\n-// WHY: ensure tooling is available and dev can elevate for all commands inside the container\n-// QUOTE(ТЗ): \"Надо дать полностью 100% права ... Доступ к Sudo\"\n-// REF: user-request-2026-01-15\n+// CHANGE: install bun+codex with global passwordless sudo inside the container\n+// WHY: allow any user/session (including Codex) to run privileged commands without prompts\n+// QUOTE(ТЗ): \"Можем ли мы делать что бы наши докер контейнеры давали полный доступ к sudo?\"\n+// REF: user-request-2026-01-16\n // SOURCE: n/a\n // FORMAT THEOREM: forall cfg: dockerfile(cfg) exposes bun+codex in PATH\n // PURITY: CORE\n // EFFECT: Effect<string, never, never>\n // INVARIANT: base image and ssh setup preserved\n@@\n RUN apt-get update && apt-get install -y --no-install-recommends \\\\\n     openssh-server git gh ca-certificates nodejs npm curl unzip bsdutils sudo \\\\\n  && rm -rf /var/lib/apt/lists/*\n \n+# Passwordless sudo for all users (container is disposable)\n+RUN printf \"%s\\\\n\" \"ALL ALL=(ALL) NOPASSWD:ALL\" > /etc/sudoers.d/zz-all \\\\\n+  && chmod 0440 /etc/sudoers.d/zz-all\n+\n # Tooling: pnpm + Codex CLI (bun)\n RUN npm i -g pnpm@${config.pnpmVersion}\n*** End Patch"}}
